ry much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Fyb1wl4", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@FCx4l/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 244828, "client_id": 451077, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4fc1da6fcc852e519043905ee730c5e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4fc1da6fcc852e519043905ee730c5e, https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a0cc8c454b95432efbfa364289267c1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5be98400ac40ebefdcbbb882c1580195 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07bca6cf753e8824bb3d798ff8fdaf3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07bca6cf753e8824bb3d798ff8fdaf3f, https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8631b4edf9e19bac7cb26681e087c21f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c92636c5/uploads/origins/910272ed-08df-479a-8696-eb420a8f062e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c16c3e79c83c693920de2a0d71c1389b 3x"}, "body": "イラストの依頼失礼致します。\n私の創作キャラクターを描いて頂きたく存じます。\n資料に至らない点が有りましたら申し訳ありません。\n元々のデザインが曖昧なので、適宜アレンジして頂ければ幸いです。\n　\nポーズや構図の指定等は特に無いので、お任せでお願い致します。\n\n背景の有無についての記述が無かったので、もし可能である場合は、\n快晴の、高い枯れ木が並び立つ長い雪道をお願いしたいです。\nもし背景は無理という場合は、上記の指定は破棄して頂いて構いません。\n\nfcx4lさんの描かれる、雪と餅の間みたいな質感のキラキラした絵が本当に好きで、\n兼ねてよりskebに依頼を出来るようになった際には是非依頼したいと考えていたので、\nもし宜しければ、依頼の方よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-2st3x0lgfXy8bQH3IfbOL3Gl2E8ywd0", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1232126, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "のろヰ COMITIA156【D50b】", "screen_name": "rnatataki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1137491982404603906/iRcXCVNY.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/842278046748966912/1747861467/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 1329791, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "𝕹𝖎𝖗𝖛𝖆𝖓𝖆 𝖂𝖔𝖗𝖑𝖉", "screen_name": "meidodowwn", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1509736875644588044/eD7mAEOV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1361807078440923140/1720238008/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 2657048, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "くら", "screen_name": "kurakura28", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2043350465111592960/n1ZmUGqH.